  "details": "The idea of is for VRC asset to have a component in said component you refence a object.\n\nyou have set of udon/animator  controlled settings.\n\nwhen the world is build the project is split into asset bundles base on the component settings.\n\nwhen the world is loaded by the cilent it only downloads the root asset.\n\nBased off udon the extra assets can be downloaded and will be attached to the object where was meant to refenced. it is up to world creator to make sure everything works correctly.\n\nthis could also be used to unload assets that are no longer needed  freeing up ram vram and material slots for very long and complex worlds or removing things a user doesnt want e.g. pool tables or arcade games.\n\nthis also could be applyed to avatars as well.\n\npeople may have avatars with 100 sets of cloths but only need to show one or a few if you could unload unused slots or remove tris to also save vram and such.",
